50:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: What brings you here?
51:Malcolm: I don't know... Maybe we're here because Valtaria was attacked by "The Guest" in Dyron's armor.
52:[$E4DFEC]Eryt[$FFFFFF]: We have to come up with a plan.
53:[$CC00C0]Guard[$FFFFFF]: Sir! We found this spy in Berg's forest lodges.
54:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: A spy in my city?? There's no way to get here without special maps.
55:[$CC00C0]Guard[$FFFFFF]: He carries a black flag.
56:Malcolm: The Black Inquisition has returned. Ehh
57:[$E4DFEC]Eryt[$FFFFFF]: And that can only mean one thing...
58:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: Kregor...
59:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: Speak, spy! What orders did you receive?
60:[$333333]Spy[$FFFFFF]: Kill me. My fate is sealed anyway. He will soon come for your city.
61:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: ...
62:Malcolm: I think he's already here.
63:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: Close ranks! Everyone to defensive positions! And take him to the dungeons!
64:Stop the incoming attack. The enemy cannot destroy more than 40 buildings.